meta {
  name: ReserveringBevestigHappyPath
  type: http
  seq: 72
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/web/bon/{{bevestigBonnr}}/lijn/{{bevestigLijnnr}}/reservering/bevestig
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Auth-Token: {{authToken}}
  Accept: application/json
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.bonnr: eq {{bevestigBonnr}}
  res.body.lijnnr: eq {{bevestigLijnnr}}
  res.body.gereserv: eq 1
}

docs {
  bon-auto-reservering design doc section 2 - confirms the entire pending
  reservation (bonlijn.gereserv = 1) for {{bevestigBonnr}}/
  {{bevestigLijnnr}}, moving it from artikel.besteld-kl to
  artikel.gereserveerd. Asserts gereserv is UNCHANGED (still 1) -
  confirmation moves WHERE the reservation is accounted for on artikel,
  never bonlijn.gereserv itself. The besteld-kl/gereserveerd field move
  itself is not independently observable through the documented
  bon/bonlijn HTTP contract (no exposed GET on artikel's reservation
  fields) - same limitation already noted by
  AutoReserveringHappyPathBom.bru; confirmed via direct ABL/DB query
  during backend-coder implementation. Requires {{bevestigBonnr}}/
  {{bevestigLijnnr}} (run "ReserveringBevestigSetupLijn" first). Backed by
  Luna.BusinessLogic.BonLijnReserveringBevestigingBE.
}
